@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 90
hide empty description

state "Not on leave" as NotOnLeave
state "On leave" as OnLeave
state "Leave ended" as Ended
Ended : The date stays in the data file,
Ended : but the contact is shown
Ended : as not on leave.

[*] -down-> NotOnLeave : add without lv/
[*] -right-> OnLeave : add with lv/DATE

NotOnLeave -right-> OnLeave : edit lv/DATE
OnLeave -right-> OnLeave : edit lv/NEW_DATE
OnLeave -down-> Ended : the day after\nDATE begins
OnLeave -left-> NotOnLeave : edit lv/
Ended -up-> OnLeave : edit lv/DATE
Ended -left-> NotOnLeave : edit lv/
@enduml